{"seq":2,"slug":"warehouse-distribution-network","title":"仓配网络与分销设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/warehouse-distribution-network","wordCount":1389,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"仓配网络与分销设计\">仓配网络与分销设计</h1><p>供应链物流的&quot;放在哪&quot;问题——仓库数量、位置、层级关系——是一个典型的设施选址（Facility Location）问题。选址决策一旦落地，通常意味着数年的租约或资产投入，难以快速调整。仓配网络的好坏直接决定了配送时效、物流成本和库存水位的上下限。对于电商供应链，2026 年的核心趋势是&quot;分层网络 + 智能调拨&quot;：中心仓保广度，前置仓保速度，AI 动态决定每单从哪里出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-仓网拓扑结构\">核心概念：仓网拓扑结构</h2><p>仓配网络设计需要回答三个核心问题：建几层、每层几个节点、每个节点覆盖什么区域。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    CDC[中央配送中心 CDC&lt;br/&gt;全品类存储] --&gt; RDC1[区域配送中心 RDC&lt;br/&gt;华东]&#10;    CDC --&gt; RDC2[区域配送中心 RDC&lt;br/&gt;华南]&#10;    CDC --&gt; RDC3[区域配送中心 RDC&lt;br/&gt;华北]&#10;    RDC1 --&gt; FFC1[前置仓 FFC&lt;br/&gt;上海]&#10;    RDC1 --&gt; FFC2[前置仓 FFC&lt;br/&gt;杭州]&#10;    RDC2 --&gt; FFC3[前置仓 FFC&lt;br/&gt;广州]&#10;    RDC2 --&gt; FFC4[前置仓 FFC&lt;br/&gt;深圳]&#10;    RDC3 --&gt; FFC5[前置仓 FFC&lt;br/&gt;北京]\">graph TB\n    CDC[中央配送中心 CDC&lt;br/&gt;全品类存储] --&gt; RDC1[区域配送中心 RDC&lt;br/&gt;华东]\n    CDC --&gt; RDC2[区域配送中心 RDC&lt;br/&gt;华南]\n    CDC --&gt; RDC3[区域配送中心 RDC&lt;br/&gt;华北]\n    RDC1 --&gt; FFC1[前置仓 FFC&lt;br/&gt;上海]\n    RDC1 --&gt; FFC2[前置仓 FFC&lt;br/&gt;杭州]\n    RDC2 --&gt; FFC3[前置仓 FFC&lt;br/&gt;广州]\n    RDC2 --&gt; FFC4[前置仓 FFC&lt;br/&gt;深圳]\n    RDC3 --&gt; FFC5[前置仓 FFC&lt;br/&gt;北京]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>仓库层级</th>\n<th>典型数量</th>\n<th>SKU 广度</th>\n<th>服务时效</th>\n<th>核心功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CDC（中央仓）</td>\n<td>1-2 个</td>\n<td>全量 SKU</td>\n<td>3-5 天</td>\n<td>集中存储、长尾品配送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RDC（区域仓）</td>\n<td>3-8 个</td>\n<td>热销 70% SKU</td>\n<td>1-2 天</td>\n<td>区域覆盖、次日达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FFC（前置仓）</td>\n<td>50-200+ 个</td>\n<td>Top 15% SKU</td>\n<td>30分钟-4小时</td>\n<td>即时配送、半日达</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"设施选址的优化建模\">设施选址的优化建模</h2><p>设施选址是经典的混合整数规划（MIP）问题。简化模型如下：</p>\n<p>目标函数——最小化总成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum_{j \\in J} f_j y_j + \\sum_{i \\in I}\\sum_{j \\in J} c_{ij} x_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4304em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4304em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为开设仓库 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的固定成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_j \\in \\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 为是否开设的决策变量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为从仓库 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 服务客户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的单位运输成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为分配比例。</p>\n<p>约束条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>每个客户必须被服务</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{j \\in J} x_{ij} = 1 \\quad \\forall i \\in I \\quad (每个客户必须被服务)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4304em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每个客户必须被服务</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>只有开设的仓库才能服务</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{ij} \\leq y_j \\quad \\forall i,j \\quad (只有开设的仓库才能服务)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">只有开设的仓库才能服务</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>j</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>仓库容量约束</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i \\in I} d_i x_{ij} \\leq Cap_j \\cdot y_j \\quad \\forall j \\quad (仓库容量约束)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">仓库容量约束</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实际项目中还需要加入时效约束（如&quot;95% 的订单 48 小时内送达&quot;）和服务区域互斥/重叠约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"仓网层级决策的权衡\">仓网层级决策的权衡</h2><p>增加仓库数量（更多网络节点）带来的效果是非线性的：</p>\n<p><strong>增加节点的收益：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>缩短末端配送距离→降低配送成本→提升时效</li>\n<li>分散库存→降低单点故障风险</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>增加节点的代价：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>固定成本上升（租金、设备、人员）</li>\n<li>全网库存总量上升（每个节点都需要安全库存）</li>\n<li>管理复杂度指数级增长（调拨、盘点、系统对接）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>存在一个最优点：当配送成本下降的边际收益等于库存持有成本和固定成本上升的边际代价时，仓库数量最优。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>仓库数量</th>\n<th>运输成本</th>\n<th>库存成本</th>\n<th>固定成本</th>\n<th>总成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>偏高（运输拖累）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>趋向最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>趋向最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>偏高（库存拖累）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"配送策略-直配-vs-集配-vs-越库\">配送策略：直配 vs 集配 vs 越库</h2><p><strong>直接配送（Direct Ship）</strong> — 从供应商/工厂直接发到客户。省去了仓储环节，但运输批量小、频次高，适用于大件/定制品。</p>\n<p><strong>集中配送（Milk Run / Consolidation）</strong> — 多点取货后合并运输到配送中心。利用满载率降低单位运输成本，但增加了提前期。</p>\n<p><strong>越库操作（Cross-Docking）</strong> — 货物到达配送中心后不入库存储，直接在月台完成分拣重组并发出。结合了集配的运输效率和直配的低库存优势。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 直配&#10;        S1[供应商] --&gt; C1[客户]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 集配&#10;        S2[供应商A] --&gt; DC1[配送中心]&#10;        S3[供应商B] --&gt; DC1&#10;        DC1 --&gt; C2[客户]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 越库&#10;        S4[供应商A] --&gt; XD[越库平台]&#10;        S5[供应商B] --&gt; XD&#10;        XD --&gt; C3[客户X]&#10;        XD --&gt; C4[客户Y]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 直配\n        S1[供应商] --&gt; C1[客户]\n    end\n    subgraph 集配\n        S2[供应商A] --&gt; DC1[配送中心]\n        S3[供应商B] --&gt; DC1\n        DC1 --&gt; C2[客户]\n    end\n    subgraph 越库\n        S4[供应商A] --&gt; XD[越库平台]\n        S5[供应商B] --&gt; XD\n        XD --&gt; C3[客户X]\n        XD --&gt; C4[客户Y]\n    end</pre><p>2026 年的电商供应链大量采用&quot;混合模式&quot;：热销品走 RDC 前置备货、长尾品走 CDC 直发、大促期间开启越库模式应对峰值。系统需要支持按 SKU × 区域 × 时段动态切换配送策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"仓内布局与运营效率\">仓内布局与运营效率</h2><p>仓库内部的布局直接影响拣选效率，而拣选成本通常占仓库运营成本的 50-60%。关键布局原则：</p>\n<p><strong>ABC 分区</strong> — 高频出货品（A 类）放置在离出货口最近的黄金区域，低频品（C 类）放置在高层或深区。</p>\n<p><strong>动线设计</strong> — 减少拣选人员/设备的移动距离。U 型流（进出同侧）适合小型仓库，直线流（进出对侧）适合大型高吞吐仓库。</p>\n<p><strong>存储模式选择</strong> — 随机存储（任何空位可放）提高空间利用率，固定存储（指定货位）降低寻找时间。现代 WMS 通常采用&quot;分区固定 + 区内随机&quot;的混合策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络韧性-冗余与弹性设计\">网络韧性：冗余与弹性设计</h2><p>2026 年的供应链强调韧性，仓配网络设计需要考虑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>节点冗余</strong> — 关键区域至少 2 个可互备的仓库节点</li>\n<li><strong>容量弹性</strong> — 预留 20-30% 的弹性空间或签订弹性仓合约（按使用量计费）</li>\n<li><strong>多路径</strong> — 每个客户区域可由至少 2 个仓库服务</li>\n<li><strong>灾备预案</strong> — 单仓故障时的自动切换逻辑</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>仓配网络设计是&quot;建几层、几个节点、覆盖什么区域&quot;的设施选址问题。</li>\n<li>增加仓库数量的收益（降运输成本）与代价（增库存/固定成本）存在最优平衡点。</li>\n<li>直配/集配/越库三种配送策略各有适用场景，现代电商采用按 SKU 动态切换。</li>\n<li>仓内 ABC 分区和动线设计直接决定拣选效率。</li>\n<li>韧性设计要求节点冗余、容量弹性和多路径覆盖。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"transportation-freight-management\">运输与货运管理</a> — 货物出仓之后的干线与末端运输决策</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ecommerce-logistics/warehouse-and-fulfillment/warehouse-management\">电商物流：仓储管理</a> — 仓库运营的具体执行细节</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"仓配网络与分销设计","id":"仓配网络与分销设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：仓网拓扑结构","id":"核心概念-仓网拓扑结构"},{"level":2,"text":"设施选址的优化建模","id":"设施选址的优化建模"},{"level":2,"text":"仓网层级决策的权衡","id":"仓网层级决策的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"配送策略：直配 vs 集配 vs 越库","id":"配送策略-直配-vs-集配-vs-越库"},{"level":2,"text":"仓内布局与运营效率","id":"仓内布局与运营效率"},{"level":2,"text":"网络韧性：冗余与弹性设计","id":"网络韧性-冗余与弹性设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"库存管理与优化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/inventory-management-optimization"},"next":{"title":"运输与货运管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/transportation-freight-management"}}